VOIDFALL
A black screen where snow falls from wherever your mouse or finger.

Description

VOIDFALL is a small interactive animation that runs in the broswer. You start with an empty black screen.Move your mouse and snowflakes appear along your path. The faster you move, the more flakes you get.

The flakes are not just decoration. Your cursor also pushes the flakes around it, so you can sweep them away like wind. They fall slowly. When a flake reach the bottom, it add to a small pile of snow. The pile slowly spreads out and melts away, so it never grows forever.

There is also a light film grain on top to give it a  soft, old-screen look. Bigger flakes get a faint glow and are a bit more see-through, and smaller ones are sharper.

it is made with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

