Dependencies

A modern broswer(chrome, Firefox, safari..)
nothing to install..

Installing
Download or clone this repo

https://github.com/arunreddyyy/fall.git

Executing program
Open index.html in your browser.
Move you mouse around the screen to make snow
On a phone or tablet, drag your finger instead.


Help

I see only a black screen. That is normal at start. Snow only appears when you move. Clicking alone does nothing.

It feels slow on my device. Open script.js and lower "maxFlekes" or density at top of the file.

The snow pile at the bottom is too big or too small. Change "maxPile". Both are at top of script.js.

I want the cursor to push the snow more or less. "Change pushRadius in script.js.


AI Usage

I wrote this project myself.I used AI for help with the small math issues.

Everything else, the structure and the settings, is my own work. Estimated AI share of the project is abot 10-15%.
